invariant: INV-19
file: srv_out.h
catches: webpki_loop_tx_record
reason: srv_frag's buffer is sized by CH_TX_PT again, so a TX_RECORD=16384
  build puts 16 KiB on srv_send_certificate's stack frame, four times the
  4,096-byte budget of a TRUST=webpki object. Every default build is byte for
  byte the same, because CH_TX_PT is 512 there. In the TX_RECORD build the
  Certificate then leaves as one record rather than three, which the loop's
  record count objects to.

--- old
    uint8_t buf[SRV_FRAG_MAX];
--- new
    uint8_t buf[CH_TX_PT];
